librated; no Circular T traceability.</dd><dt>Tests</dt><dd><code>tests/ppp_time_igs_station_clock.rs (WTZR 2025-02-24, 04:00-05:55, 24 epochs: Kshana minus IGS std 0.075 ns, bar 0.20; mean -0.659 ns, bar 5.0)</code></dd></dl></details><details class="lg-row" data-fl-item data-s="v" data-g="clock"><summary><span class="st st-v">Validated</span><span class="lg-req">Float precise point positioning on real RINEX observations</span><code class="lg-mod">ppp_<wbr>real <wbr>(run_<wbr>ppp,<wbr> <wbr>parse_<wbr>antex_<wbr>receiver,<wbr> <wbr>solid_<wbr>tide_<wbr>ecef,<wbr> <wbr>phase_<wbr>windup)</code></summary><dl class="lg-body"><dt>Capability</dt><dd>Static float PPP extended Kalman filter on real dual-frequency GPS code and carrier phase with IGS final orbits and clocks: ionosphere-free combination, satellite and receiver antenna offsets (receiver variations), solid Earth tide, phase wind-up, Shapiro delay, estimated zenith wet delay, per-arc float ambiguities with geometry-free / Melbourne-Wübbena slip detection</dd><dt>Oracle</dt><dd>Published ITRF2020 coordinate of WTZR (IGN ITRF2020_GNSS.SSC, solution 3, propagated with its velocity) — bars pre-registered in tests/fixtures/gnss_wettzell_2025055/PREREGISTRATION_PPP.md before the filter was written; development on the co-located station WTZZ only. Not modelled: ocean loading, satellite PCV, integer ambiguity resolution</dd><dt>Tests</dt><dd><code>tests/ppp_real_wettzell_oracle.rs (IGS station WTZR, 2025-02-24 00-06 h, 30 s, held out from development: last-epoch horizontal 1.5 mm, up −2.9 cm; 04-06 h 240/240 epochs within 0.10 m 3-D, p95 6.7 cm; code-only p95…</code></dd></dl></details><details class="lg-row" data-fl-item data-s="v" data-g="integrity"><summary><span class="st st-v">Validated</span><span class="lg-req">RINEX 4 navigation file reading</span><code class="lg-mod">rinex <wbr>(parse_<wbr>nav,<wbr> <wbr>parse_<wbr>nav_<wbr>with)</code></summary><dl class="lg-body"><dt>Capability</dt><dd>RINEX 4.00-4.02 naviga